{'Parameters': 'suppress-policy route-policy-name3', 'Info': 'Specifies the name of a route-policy for suppressing the advertisement of specified routes.\nThe name is a string of 1 to 200 case-sensitive characters, with spaces not supported. When double quotation marks are used around the string, spaces are allowed in the string.'}
