The display bgp vpnv4 routing-table command displays information about BGP VPNv4 routes and BGP VPN routes.
The display bgp routing-table command displays information about BGP public network routes.
The display bgp labeled routing-table command displays information about BGP routes in a BGP labeled address family.
ParaDef:
{'Parameters': 'ipv4-address', 'Info': 'Specifies the IPv4 address of a peer.\nThe value is in dotted decimal notation.'}
{'Parameters': 'mask', 'Info': 'Specifies a mask in dotted decimal notation.\nIt is in dotted decimal notation.'}
{'Parameters': 'mask-length', 'Info': 'Specifies the mask length.\nThe value is an integer ranging from 0 to 32.'}
{'Parameters': 'as-path', 'Info': 'Displays AS_Path attribute information.\n-'}
{'Parameters': 'community-list', 'Info': 'Displays a community attribute list of routes.\n-'}
{'Parameters': 'large-community', 'Info': 'Displays the BGP routes with the specified Large-Community attribute.\n-'}
{'Parameters': 'ext-community', 'Info': 'Displays an extended community attribute list of routes.\n-'}
{'Parameters': 'cluster-list', 'Info': 'Displays a cluster list of routes.\n-'}
{'Parameters': 'advertised-peer', 'Info': 'Displays the list of the peers to which a public network route is advertised.\n-'}
{'Parameters': 'all', 'Info': 'Displays all the VPNv4 and VPN instance routes.\n-'}
{'Parameters': 'vpn-instance vpn-instance-name', 'Info': 'Specifies the name of a VPN instance.\nThe value is a string of 1 to 31 case-sensitive characters, spaces not supported. In addition, the VPN instance name must not be _public_. When double quotation marks are used around the string, spaces are allowed in the string.'}
{'Parameters': 'peer remoteIpv4Addr', 'Info': 'Specifies the IPv4 address of a peer on which IP routes are to be displayed.\nIt is in dotted decimal notation.'}
{'Parameters': 'advertised-routes', 'Info': 'Displays public network routes advertised to a specified peer.\n-'}
{'Parameters': 'instance instance-name', 'Info': 'Specifies the name of a BGP multi-instance.\nThe value is a string of 1 to 31 case-sensitive characters, spaces not supported. When double quotation marks are used around the string, spaces are allowed in the string.'}
{'Parameters': 'remoteIpv6Addr', 'Info': 'Specify an IPv6 peer address.\nThe value is a 32-digit hexadecimal number, in the format of X:X:X:X:X:X:X:X.'}
