{'Parameters': 'received-routes', 'Info': 'Displays the routes learned from a specified peer.\n-'}
{'Parameters': 'advertised-routes', 'Info': 'Displays the routes advertised to a specified peer.\n-'}
{'Parameters': 'time-range start-time', 'Info': 'Starting time ([0-10000]d[0-23]h[0-59]m[0-59]s).\nThe value is an integer ranging from 0 to 4294967295.'}
{'Parameters': 'time-range end-time', 'Info': 'Ending time ([0-10000]d[0-23]h[0-59]m[0-59]s).\nThe value is an integer ranging from 0 to 4294967295.'}
