{'Parameters': 'discard', 'Info': 'Discards specified path attributes.\n-'}
{'Parameters': 'withdraw', 'Info': 'Withdraws BGP routes with specified path attributes.\n-'}
{'Parameters': 'treat-as-unknown', 'Info': 'Processes the specified attributes as unknown attributes. If a specified attribute is optional transitive, the BGP device accepts this attribute and advertises it to other peers; if the specified attribute is of any other type, the BGP device discards this attribute.\n-'}
