## User question:
How to configure Huawei NE40E router to allow labeled routes recursing to IP addresses to participate in BGP IPv6 SR-Policy best path selection?
---
## Proposed answer:
route-policy bgp-sr-policy permit node 10
if-match mpls-label
apply preference 100
---
